From: fvs-build <https://github.com/Vibrant-Planet-Open-Science/fvs-build>
Subject: [PATCH] fvsOL: make Local mode work behind a reverse-proxy subpath on Linux

Vendored by docker/Dockerfile.fvs-gui, which applies it with `git apply` before
building the fvsOL package, then asserts the result. `git apply` refuses fuzzy
application on purpose: an interface_ref bump that moves these lines fails the
build loudly instead of silently shipping unpatched code.

Rationale for each hunk, and the exit criteria for deleting this file, are in
docs/workflow-interface.md; the upstream issue drafts are under docs/plans/.

1. "View On Maps" popup graphs (server.R:5933). With Display=graph, each stand's
   leaflet marker popup shows a per-stand PNG written to ./www/s<sid>.png and
   served via addResourcePath("www", ...). The isLocal() branch addresses it as
   an origin-absolute "/www/s<sid>.png", which 404s whenever the app is served
   under a path prefix. The other branch derives the URL from
   session$clientData$url_pathname, which is correct both behind a proxy and
   with no proxy at all (url_pathname is "/"), so the special case buys nothing
   and costs Local mode every popup graph on that tab.

2/3. Lock-file name case (server.R:8783, 8920). The file is written as
   projectIsLocked.txt (server.R:224) and read back with that spelling
   everywhere else, but these two removals spell it ProjectIsLocked.txt. On a
   case-sensitive filesystem the removal silently fails, so every project the
   user leaves keeps a stale lock -- and getProjectList() drops locked
   projects, so the project vanishes from the picker with no way back.
---
--- a/fvsOL/R/server.R
+++ b/fvsOL/R/server.R
@@ -5930,8 +5930,7 @@
             url = paste0(session$clientData$url_protocol,"//",
                          session$clientData$url_hostname,
                          session$clientData$url_pathname)
-            pfile=if (isLocal()) paste0("/www/s",sid,".png") else
-                                 paste0(url,"www/s",sid,".png")
+            pfile=paste0(url,"www/s",sid,".png")
             HTML(paste0('<img src="',pfile,'?',as.character(as.numeric(Sys.time())),
                         '" alt="',sid,'" style="width:229px;height:170px;">'))
           }
@@ -8780,7 +8779,7 @@
       { 
         if (isLocal()) 
         {
-        file.remove('./ProjectIsLocked.txt')
+        file.remove('./projectIsLocked.txt')
         setwd(newPrj)
         globals$reloadAppIsSet=1
         session$reload()    
@@ -8917,7 +8916,7 @@
               return()
             }
 
-            file.remove('./ProjectIsLocked.txt')
+            file.remove('./projectIsLocked.txt')
             setwd(dirPath)
             globals$reloadAppIsSet=1
             session$reload()
